==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Altair|Altair]] is the brightest star in the constellation of Aquila and the 12th-brightest star in the night sky.
**The aforementioned constellation's name is Latin for "eagle" and represents the bird that carried Zeus/Jupiter's thunderbolts in Greco-Roman mythology, hence the eagle on the enemy base.
*The eagle's white hood may be a reference to Altaïr Ibn-La'Ahad from the ''Assassin's Creed'' series.

